  "description": "It was discovered that the Go x/net/idna package, vendored in Google Guest\nAgent and Google OS Config Agent, incorrectly accepted Punycode-encoded\nlabels that decoded to ASCII-only labels when processing internationalized\ndomain names. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to bypass\nhostname-based access controls and escalate privileges.",
